    title: "go: a typed receiver's method declared on an EMBEDDED INTERFACE, or behind a cross-package type ALIAS, resolves to nothing once Type.Method is taken in the type's own package (WI-kibah residual; prometheus storage.Appender.AppendHistogram)"  # 15a1
